import json
Q=Path(__file__).resolve().parent;z=json.loads((Q/'postcheck.json').read_text())
rows=['# Specialized BG export/import — first Task3 cost process','',f"Saved audit accepted: **{z['audit_all_passed']}**. First-process ALL-EIGHT performance gate: **{z['first_process_viable']}**. Pure timeout: **{z['pure_timeout']}**.",'',f"One admitted `cost1-300` attempt, process exit `{z['process_returncode']}`, reason `{z['process_reason']}`. Guard elapsed {z['guard_elapsed']} s; supervisor elapsed {z['supervisor_elapsed']} s; outer including immutable checks and auditor {z['outer_elapsed']} s. These inclusive durations are not the warmed lifecycle benchmark. Auditor error: `{z['audit_error']}`.",'',f"Saved windows: {z['windows']}, measured: {z['measured_windows']}, window outputs: {z['saved_window_outputs']}. Validated counts: `{z['counts']}`.",'','| Case / backend | Median paired time C/R (range) | Median bytes R → C | Median events R → C | Median factor graph bytes R → C | Faster pairs | Time / allocation / memory gates |','| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |']
